    ],
    "block_content": "NEW INSIGHTS FOR THE MULTIVARIATE SQUARE-ROOT LASSO"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 1,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     173,
     185,
     1052,
     292
    ],
    "block_content": "Proof of Theorem 3. To prove Theorem 3, we follow the proof technique detailed in Negahban et al. (2012). For $\\delta > 0$, define the set $\\mathsf{B}_{\\delta,c} = \\{\\boldsymbol{\\Delta} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{p \\times q} : \\|\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}\\|_F = \\delta, g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^\\perp}) \\leq \\check{c} g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_\\mathcal{N})\\}$ and let $\\mathcal{L}(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}) = \\|\\boldsymbol{Y} - \\boldsymbol{X} \\boldsymbol{\\beta}\\|_*/ \\sqrt{n} + \\lambda g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta})$. Because $\\mathcal{L}$ is convex and $\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}_g$ is its minimizer, on $\\mathcal{A}_c$,"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 2,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     348,
     293,
     875,
     336
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ \\operatorname*{i n f}_{\\mathbf{\\Delta}\\in\\mathsf{B}_{\\delta,c}}\\left\\{\\mathcal{L}(\\mathbf{\\beta}_{*}+\\mathbf{\\Delta})-\\mathcal{L}(\\mathbf{\\beta}_{*})\\right\\}>0\\implies\\|\\hat{\\mathbf{\\beta}}_{g}-\\mathbf{\\beta}_{*}\\|_{F}\\leq\\delta. $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 3,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     172,
     347,
     1047,
     428
    ],
    "block_content": "For a proof of this fact, see the proof of Lemma 4 of the Supplementary Material to Negahban et al. (2012). To simplify notation, let  $ D(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}) = \\mathcal{L}(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_*) + \\boldsymbol{\\Delta}) - \\mathcal{L}(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_*) $ so that we need only show that  $ \\inf_{\\Delta \\in \\mathbb{B}_{\\delta,c}} D(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}) > 0 $ for  $ \\delta = \\lambda \\check{c} \\Psi_g(\\mathcal{N}) / \\phi $. Notice first that"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 4,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     242,
     448,
     980,
     503
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ D(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta})=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}\\|\\boldsymbol{Y}-\\boldsymbol{X}(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*}+\\boldsymbol{\\Delta})\\|_{*}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}\\|\\boldsymbol{Y}-\\boldsymbol{X}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*}\\|_{*}+\\lambda g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*}+\\boldsymbol{\\Delta})-\\lambda g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*}) $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 5,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     295,
     510,
     877,
     560
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ \\geq\\phi\\|\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}\\|_{F}^{2}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}|\\mathrm{tr}(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}^{\\top}\\boldsymbol{X}^{\\top}\\boldsymbol{U}_{\\epsilon}\\boldsymbol{V}_{\\epsilon}^{\\top})|+\\lambda g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*}+\\boldsymbol{\\Delta})-\\lambda g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*}) $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 6,
    "block_label": "formula_number",
    "block_bbox": [
     1004,
     518,
     1044,
     544
    ],
    "block_content": "(24)"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 7,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     302,
     566,
     871,
     616
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ \\geq\\phi\\|\\mathbf{\\Delta}\\|_{F}^{2}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}|\\mathrm{tr}(\\mathbf{\\Delta}^{\\top}\\mathbf{X}^{\\top}\\mathbf{U}_{\\epsilon}\\mathbf{V}_{\\epsilon}^{\\top})|+\\lambda g(\\mathbf{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}})-\\lambda g(\\mathbf{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}}) $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 8,
    "block_label": "formula_number",
    "block_bbox": [
     1004,
     576,
     1043,
     601
    ],
    "block_content": "(25)"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 9,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     172,
     640,
     1051,
     694
    ],
    "block_content": "where (24) follows from the fact that  $ \\boldsymbol{\\Delta} \\in \\mathsf{B}_{\\delta,c} $ implies  $ \\boldsymbol{\\Delta} \\in \\mathcal{C}_{g}(\\mathcal{M}, \\mathcal{N}, c) $ and Lemma 13; and (25) follows from the triangle inequality"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 10,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     173,
     716,
     1047,
     745
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*}+\\boldsymbol{\\Delta})-g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*})=g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*\\mathcal{M}}+\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}}+\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}})-g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*\\mathcal{M}})\\geq g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*\\mathcal{M}}+\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}})-g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}})-g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*\\mathcal{M}}), $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 11,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     173,
     766,
     952,
     792
    ],
    "block_content": "and decomposability of the penalty function g with respect to the pair  $ (\\mathcal{M},\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}) $"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 12,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     173,
     814,
     1060,
     843
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*\\mathcal{M}}+\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}})-g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}})-g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*\\mathcal{M}})=g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*\\mathcal{M}})+g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}})-g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}})-g(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{*\\mathcal{M}})=g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}})-g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}}). $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 13,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     174,
     864,
     860,
     890
    ],
    "block_content": "Thus, applying Hölder's inequality to the second term in (25), we have"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 14,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     242,
     915,
     872,
     967
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ D(\\mathbf{\\Delta})\\geq\\phi\\|\\mathbf{\\Delta}\\|_{F}^{2}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}g(\\mathbf{\\Delta})\\tilde{g}(\\mathbf{X}^{\\top}\\mathbf{U}_{\\epsilon}\\mathbf{V}_{\\epsilon}^{\\top})+\\lambda g(\\mathbf{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}})-\\lambda g(\\mathbf{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}}). $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 15,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     173,
     993,
     781,
     1021
    ],
    "block_content": "It then follows that on event  $ \\mathcal{A}_c = \\{\\lambda \\geq (c/\\sqrt{n})\\tilde{g}(X^\\top U_\\epsilon V_\\epsilon^\\top)\\} $,"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 16,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     242,
     1046,
     869,
     1206
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ \\begin{align*}D(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta})&\\geq\\phi\\|\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}\\|_{F}^{2}-\\frac{\\lambda}{c}g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta})+\\lambda g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^\\perp})-\\lambda g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}}),\\\\&\\geq\\phi\\|\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}\\|_{F}^{2}-\\frac{\\lambda}{c}g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}})-\\frac{\\lambda}{c}g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^\\perp})+\\lambda g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^\\perp})-\\lambda g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}}),\\\\&=\\phi\\|\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}\\|_{F}^{2}-\\lambda\\left(\\frac{c+1}{c}\\right)g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}})+\\lambda\\left(\\frac{c-1}{c}\\right)g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^\\perp}),\\end{align*} $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 17,
    "block_label": "formula_number",
    "block_bbox": [
     1005,
     1112,
     1043,
     1137
    ],
    "block_content": "(26)"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 18,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     173,
     1225,
     1018,
     1251
    ],
    "block_content": "where (26) follows from the triangle equality  $ g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}) \\leq g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}}) + g(\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}}) $. Then, because"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 19,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     329,
     1270,
     892,
     1323
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ g(\\mathbf{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}})\\leq\\Psi_{g}(\\mathcal{N})\\|\\mathbf{\\Delta}\\|_{F}\\quad\\mathrm{~a n d~}\\quad\\lambda\\left(\\frac{c-1}{c}\\right)g(\\mathbf{\\Delta}_{\\mathcal{N}^{\\perp}})\\geq0, $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 20,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     175,
     1344,
     317,
     1367
    ],
    "block_content": "it follows that"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 21,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     399,
     1363,
     822,
     1417
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ D(\\mathbf{\\Delta})\\geq\\phi\\|\\mathbf{\\Delta}\\|_{F}^{2}-\\lambda\\left(\\frac{c+1}{c}\\right)\\Psi_{g}(\\mathcal{N})\\|\\mathbf{\\Delta}\\|_{F}. $$ "
   },
